  "text": "For illustrators designing props in a fictional film, this currency features a central woven sun, symbolizing shared labor and collective effort. The reverse side displays nine square windows, each representing a distinct district within the imagined city—architectural fragments of civic life. A deep violet border frames the note, lending it both elegance and a sense of mystery. The woven sun is rendered in metallic thread, catching light with subtle movement. Each window is precisely aligned, with etched borders suggesting transparency and hidden narratives. The design balances symbolic depth with visual precision, ensuring clarity under cinematic lighting. This currency is not just money—it is a map of community, history, and shared purpose."
